{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, spin up, and beat the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin Evolution</strong> takes the classic ball-rolling genre and injects it with endless replayability. Built around a dynamic, procedurally generated course system, every run throws a new combination of straightaways, sharp turns, and treacherous intersections at you. Memorization won't save you here\u2014only pure reflexes and physics mastery will get you to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a speedrunner looking to optimize your route for the perfect time, or a completionist hunting down every single collectible item hidden across the track, the course is always ready for one more attempt.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1021240?t=1772978738","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1021240?t=1772978738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1021240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772978738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1021240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772978738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, spin up, and beat the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin Evolution</strong> takes the classic ball-rolling genre and injects it with endless replayability. Built around a dynamic, procedurally generated course system, every run throws a new combination of straightaways, sharp turns, and treacherous intersections at you. Memorization won't save you here\u2014only pure reflexes and physics mastery will get you to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a speedrunner looking to optimize